$$
\dbinom{31}{28} = \frac{31 \times 30 \times 29 \times \cancel{28!}}{28! \cdot 3!} = \frac{31 \times 30 \times 29}{3!}
$$

Next, compute the denominator $3! = 3 \times 2 \times 1 = 6$:

$$
\dbinom{31}{28} = \frac{31 \times 30 \times 29}{6}
$$

